    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb two bedroom open plan second floor apartment with a stylish interior ideally located in the heart of The City Centre.\r\n\r\nThis stunning property has been maintained to a very high standard and features an entrance hall with laminate floors and utility/hotpress. To the left of the hallway is a recently refurbished generous sized bathroom with a tiled floor, partially tiled walls, a towel radiator and high spec sanitary ware. Both bedrooms enjoy laminate floors & sophisticated fitted wardrobes while the main bedroom also has space for a home office. The light filled open plan living room & dining area boasts a south easterly aspect with a sliding door to a balconette overlooking the communal gardens. The accommodation is completed by an eye catching L shaped kitchen with a tiled floor, splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space.\r\n\r\nPackenham House is ideally located on Patrick's Street and has a rear entrance on Francis Street with plenty of cafes, restaurants, bars & shops nearby. The city centre including Grafton Street, St. Stephen's Green and Dame Street are just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nYear of construction 1994\r\nService charge €1695\r\nSecond floor\r\nOpen plan\r\nHigh spec interior\r\nRefurbished bathroom\r\nEye catching kitchen\r\nUtility room\r\nCentral location"
